### N-gram endpoints — debug mode (FastAPI: backend only, port 8000)
### Run requests in order: estimate → query → status → page → archive
### Copy a ticket_id from the query response and paste it into the @ticketId variable below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/v1/tools
@ticketId = f0c1e66e-9556-4bd0-9c4b-fe9169c5e26b
@archiveTicketId = PASTE_ARCHIVE_TICKET_ID_HERE

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Estimate hits before submitting a query
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Estimate — word in vocabulary, no filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/estimate?word=statsminister
Accept: application/json

###

### Estimate — word in vocabulary with year filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/estimate?word=statsminister&from_year=1970&to_year=1990
Accept: application/json

###

### Estimate — word likely not in vocabulary
GET {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/estimate?word=xyzzy_notaword
Accept: application/json

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. Submit a query — returns 202 with ticket_id
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Query — sliding window, width 2, no filters
POST {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": "statsminister",
  "width": 2,
  "target": "word",
  "mode": "sliding",
  "filters": {}
}

###

### Query — left-aligned, width 3, year range filter
POST {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": "statsminister",
  "width": 3,
  "target": "word",
  "mode": "left-aligned",
  "filters": {
    "from_year": 1970,
    "to_year": 1990
  }
}

###

### Query — lemma target with chamber filter
POST {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": "arbeta",
  "width": 2,
  "target": "lemma",
  "mode": "sliding",
  "filters": {
    "chamber_abbrev": ["AK"]
  }
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. Poll status — paste ticket_id from query response into @ticketId above
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Status — check ticket (pending → ready)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/status/{{ticketId}}
Accept: application/json

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. Fetch a results page — ticket must be READY
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Page 1, default page size (50 rows), sorted by count descending
GET {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/page/{{ticketId}}?page=1&sort_by=window_count&sort_order=desc
Accept: application/json

###

### Page 1, 10 rows, sorted by ngram ascending
GET {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/page/{{ticketId}}?page=1&page_size=10&sort_by=ngram&sort_order=asc
Accept: application/json

###

### Page 2, 25 rows, sorted by count descending
GET {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/page/{{ticketId}}?page=2&page_size=25&sort_by=window_count&sort_order=desc
Accept: application/json

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 5. Prepare an archive for download — ticket must be READY
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Archive — CSV (gzipped)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/archive/{{ticketId}}?archive_format=csv_gz
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Archive — Excel
POST {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/archive/{{ticketId}}?archive_format=xlsx
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Archive — JSONL (gzipped)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/archive/{{ticketId}}?archive_format=jsonl_gz
Content-Type: application/json

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 6. Download the archive — paste archive_ticket_id from archive response
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Download archive (retrieval_url from archive response)
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/downloads/{{archiveTicketId}}/download
Accept: */*

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 7. Legacy synchronous endpoint (deprecated, kept for comparison)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Legacy GET — synchronous n-gram result, sliding window width 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/ngrams/statsminister?width=2&target=word&mode=sliding
Accept: application/json

